# steamdecklauncher: ProtonUp + Flatseal in one iced window (software renderer, private HOME, nothing is clicked that changes a system)
Window gui
Size 1100x700
Title "steamdecklauncher"
Env ICED_BACKEND=tiny-skia
Run ${STEAMDECKLAUNCHER:-steamdecklauncher}
WaitFor settle 800ms 40s
Caption "steamdecklauncher - ProtonUp and Flatseal in one small window" bottom
Sleep 2s
MouseMove 822 71 700ms
MouseClick
WaitFor settle 800ms 20s
Caption "ProtonUp: a Proton and launch options per game" bottom
Sleep 1500ms
MouseMove 89 188 600ms
MouseClick
WaitFor settle 1500ms 30s
Caption "Download Proton: Proton-GE and friends, one click" bottom
Sleep 2500ms
MouseMove 951 71 700ms
MouseClick
WaitFor settle 800ms 20s
Caption "Flatseal: permissions per Flatpak app" bottom
Sleep 2500ms
MouseMove 1051 71 700ms
MouseClick
WaitFor settle 800ms 20s
Caption "Log: what the window did" bottom
Sleep 2s
Loop
